"mobile-note":{"x":3960,"y":26320,"w":420,"maxH":600,"fill":"orange","text":"Mobile rules\n\n• Dashed line = bottom of the first screen (844px).\n• Sticky bottom bar with Start your design + call button on every page except the design flow.\n• Sections stack to one column; card rows become swipe rows.\n• Before/after sliders keep working with a thumb drag.\n• Design flow: one question per screen, big tap targets, keyboard-friendly fields (tel, email, N-number in caps)."},
"legend":{"x":3200,"y":5120,"w":520,"maxH":900,"fill":"orange","text":"How to read these wireframes\n\n• Gray hatched boxes = image or video. The label says what goes there.\n• Small gray tags (01 · Hero) number each section. The media & motion brief will reference these numbers.\n• Pages titled TEMPLATE are built once and filled from the CMS. Blue {curly fields} are the data each instance fills in.\n• Start Your Design screens live on the Air Sew Website Mockups canvas.\n• Every page ends in the same closing CTA band and footer."}
